ani</given-names></name><name><surname>Di Mario</surname><given-names>Massimo</given-names></name><name><surname>Marterango</surname><given-names>Paolo</given-names></name><name><surname>Daniellle</surname><given-names>Santa</given-names></name><name><surname>Limite</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Pettinato</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Contegiacomo</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Loss of h MSH2 expression in primary breast cancer with p53 alterations</article-title><source>Oncology Reports</source><year>2004</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>845</fpage><lpage>851</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15010883</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Murata</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Khattar</surname><given-names>NH</given-names></name><name><surname>Gu</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>GM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Roles of mismatch repair proteins hMSH2 and hMLH1 in the development of sporadic breast cancer</article-title><source>Cancer Lett</source><volume>223</volume><fpage>14</fpage><comment>2005 Jun 1</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ahn</surname><given-names>Byung Ho Son Sei Hyun</given-names></name><name><surname>Ko</surname><given-names>Chang Dae</given-names></name><name><surname>Ka</surname><given-names>In Wha</given-names></name><name><surname>Gong</surname><given-names>Gyung Yeop</given-names></name><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>Jin Cheon</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Significance of Mismatch Repair Protein Expression in the Chemotherapeutic Response of Sporadic Invasive Ductal Carcinoma of the Breast</article-title><source>The Breast Journal</source